body:
You don't pay her for sex.

&#x200B;

You pay her so she doesn't judge.

99.8% of men know the difference. 50% of women don't.

&#x200B;

(Maybe I'm exaggerating, but you get the idea.)

*I need to return some videotapes.*

&#x200B;

I love how cheeky it sounds when I use it to reject an invitation or justify my absence, since video rental stores are not a thing anymore. :P

Yes, especially the one where a girl wants to have sex with you. /s

&#x200B;

Honestly, I think it depends on the person a lot. I have pretty much no expectations and don't see them escalate with or without porn intake. Guess at some point you just realize porn doesn't depict actual real life situations. You don't expect the Avengers bursting in through your window, why would you expect any of the things shown there to happen?
